;; data/datascript-tx.edn — the Confindustria catalog (ADR-2607141700 Wave 0).
;;
;; The facts are authored HERE and nowhere else. src/association/facts.kotoba
;; (the Clojure reading) and src/association_facts.kotoba (the Kotoba port)
;; are both generated from this file by scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk; run it
;; after editing, and `--check` says if either reading has drifted.
;;
;; Every entry carries the page it came from (:source-article) and the
;; verbatim span the claim rests on (:source-quote), in the Italian the page
;; is written in. `kbb --backend sci scripts/verify-catalog.cljk --live`
;; fetches each :url and requires that span to still be in it.
;;
;; No personal names of office-holders are persisted here. The History page
;; names the first President next to the founding date and the President
;; elected at the 1974 Assembly, the Centro Studi page names the people
;; under whom it was institutionalised, and the Organisation page names the
;; Director General; the spans quoted below stop before every name, and no
;; page is cited for its list of names.
;;
;; Every source is confindustria.it. Figures Confindustria gives about itself
;; (its number of member organisations, its surplus) are recorded as what
;; Confindustria states, not as independently measured facts; the titles say
;; so. The Valori page says 209 member organisations and the Sistema page
;; says 211; both are recorded as each page states them, not reconciled.

